  <model id="Prevention_Longevity_Map_coupled" name="Prevention &amp; Longevity Map — coupled P1+MUS Boolean model (influence graph)">
    <notes>
      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Qualitative (SBML-qual) representation of the Prevention &amp; Longevity Map coupled P1+MUS Boolean model: nodes and SIGNED regulatory influences, with a canonical sign-consistent Boolean function (a node is active when an activator is active and no inhibitor is active; basal-driven nodes are active unless repressed). The EXACT executable dynamics use MaBoSS weighted transition rates and are in the accompanying MUS_P1_coupled.bnd / .cfg files. Evidence for each edge is PubMed-curated (see MUS_module_v3.json). Generated with libSBML 5.21.2.</p>
      </body>
    </notes>
